          },
          {
            "node_id": "#/texts/839",
            "canonical_text": "Fuel Injection (Fuel System)",
            "semantic_order": 875,
            "node_type": "paragraph",
            "page_no": 62,
            "bbox": {
              "x0": 21.295490264892578,
              "y0": 772.6666259765625,
              "x1": 144.29159545898438,
              "y1": 763.2053833007812
            }
          },
          {
            "node_id": "#/texts/840",
            "canonical_text": "! The throttle position sensor is mounted in the throttle body and linked to the throttle valve.",
            "semantic_order": 876,
            "node_type": "heading",
            "page_no": 62,
            "bbox": {
              "x0": 21.235252380371094,
              "y0": 722.9461669921875,
              "x1": 505.2906494140625,
              "y1": 711.7750854492188
            }
          },
          {
            "node_id": "#/texts/841",
            "canonical_text": "! The throttle position sensor sends the ECM voltage signal corresponding to the opening of the throttle valve. When the sensor's output voltage exceeds a predetermined level, the ECM inter-",
            "semantic_order": 877,
            "node_type": "paragraph",
            "page_no": 62,
            "bbox": {
              "x0": 20.606985092163086,
              "y0": 704.0958862304688,
              "x1": 530.77587890625,
              "y1": 679.6658935546875
            }
          },
          {
            "node_id": "#/texts/842",
            "canonical_text": "prets it as complete closure of the throttle valve. When the output voltage is at another predetermined level, the ECM recognizes that the throttle valve is at a wide open position. Since the output characteristics of the sensor change over years, the ECM is provided with a learning function to be able to interpret signals into throttle valve angles always correctly.",
            "semantic_order": 878,
            "node_type": "paragraph",
            "page_no": 62,
            "bbox": {
              "x0": 20.798969268798828,
              "y0": 678.070068359375,
              "x1": 531.0970458984375,
              "y1": 627.710205078125
            }
          },
          {
